description = "A text literal in a pattern of a function the kernel checks: extracted, the part is taken out of the shape and tested with Nib's `==` on texts, as a part on `Nat` is."

@ cases.text-under-list-constructors
source = ```tauto
import std::base
import std::text
fn route(parts: List(Text)): Nat {
  match parts {
    Cons("todo", Nil) => 1
    Cons("done", Cons(_, Nil)) => 2
    _ => 0
  }
}
show(&route(["todo"]))
show(&route(["done", "x"]))
show(&route(["x"]))
show(&route([]))
```
stdout = ```
1
2
0
0
```
